        "tab-what-you-get": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "What's Included",
            "content": "<ul><li>\ud83d\udcb3 <strong>$20 Store Credit</strong> \u2014 delivered to your account automatically via email after purchase</li><li>\ud83d\udc8e <strong>15% Off Every Order</strong> \u2014 discount applied automatically at checkout for as long as you're a member</li><li>\ud83c\udf81 <strong>Free Quarterly Gifts</strong> \u2014 surprise products sent to VIP members every quarter</li><li>\ud83d\udee1 <strong>1-Year Warranty</strong> on all AutoLinkr purchases made while a member</li><li>\u26a1 <strong>Priority Support</strong> \u2014 skip the queue, get faster responses from our team</li></ul>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "tab-how-credit-works": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "How the $20 Credit Works",
            "content": "<p>After completing your membership purchase, your $20 store credit is automatically sent to the email address on your order. Simply apply it at checkout on your next purchase \u2014 no codes to remember, no manual steps.</p><p>The $20 credit can be used on any AutoLinkr product and has no expiration date.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "tab-membership-terms": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Membership Terms",
            "content": "<p>AutoLinkr VIP Membership is a one-time purchase of $9.99. There is no recurring charge or subscription \u2014 you pay once and the benefits are yours.</p><p>The 15% discount applies to all future orders placed with the same account. Quarterly gift eligibility begins 90 days after your membership purchase. Priority support access begins immediately.</p><p>Membership is non-transferable and valid for one account per purchase.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "tab-support": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Questions?",
            "content": "<p>VIP members get priority support \u2014 we respond faster and go further to make things right.</p><p>Email us at <a href=\"mailto:support@theautolinkr.com\">support@theautolinkr.com</a> and mention your VIP membership for priority handling.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        }
      },
